---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Search">
  <p>MarkRust supports in-document search. Workspace-wide search is planned for v0.2.</p>

  <h2>In-document search</h2>
  <p>Search within the active document using the command palette or dedicated search UI as it becomes available.</p>

  <h2>File navigation</h2>
  <p>Use <kbd>⌘P</kbd> to open the command palette and switch between open files by name.</p>

  <h2>Outline</h2>
  <p>The outline panel lists document headings parsed from the syntax tree. Click a heading to jump to that position.</p>
</DocsLayout>
